ent-CMWeaponPistolM48A4 = M48A4 service pistol
    .desc = A timeless classic since the first World War, the M1911A1 has limited use with the UNMC, and is also often privately bought and used as a sidearm if a standard pistol is not issued out. This is a modernized version with an ammo counter and a polymer grip, designated M48A4. Chambered in .45 ACP.
ent-CMWeaponPistolM48A4Loadout = { ent-CMWeaponPistolM48A4 }
    .desc = A timeless classic since the first World War, the M1911A1 has limited use with the UNMC, and is also often privately bought and used as a sidearm if a standard pistol is not issued out. This is a modernized version with an ammo counter and a polymer grip, designated M48A4. Chambered in .45 ACP. This one looks a bit worn and old.
    .suffix = Loadout
